Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, in the name of our king, let\Nus fight to protect the peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You have dishonored my king, and\Nthreatened the safety of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it is time for you to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You already had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over the Millennium Ring and\Nyou'll make it home with your soul intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall never hand it to the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it is I who shall see to it\Nthat your soul is the one sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even defeat me with\Nyour six friends at your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but now I am more\Npowerful than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, I buried a mighty force upon\Nthese grounds And now I've gained it back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.77,0:02:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Generations of Egypt's royal magicians\Nwere trained in this very sanctuary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is here that I locked away my\Ntrue power Then let's see you use it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Anubis!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not what your creature\Nlooked like in our last encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As the darkness within me grows,\Nmy beast continues to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster strength has also\Ngrown since last we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion magician, come hither!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the showdown commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose it's\Ntime to duel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as you say here in Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, mighty beast, attack his magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison Fang, strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, illusion magician, it is\Ntime for you to counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I shall gather\Nup my own magical energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And transfer it to my Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Increasing his attack strength
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a mere spellcaster\Ndamage my gear bound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to allow Bakura\Nto threaten my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it means depleting my\Nown powers, I must stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I sense great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if one of my sacred\Nguardians is in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad's tablet shrine is activating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this mean he's engaging\Nhis creatures in a shadow game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.67,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Donating your own energy to\Nyour magician was quite foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, your monster may be a bit stronger.\NHowever, you've left yourself somewhat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,vulnerable haven't you\Nwrong my loyal creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,will protect me and together we shall win
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician, attack the above.\NStrike his creature down at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,now shadow ghoul ambush attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the Virtuous Mahad fights dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just upset because my\Nmonsters have the upper hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Illusion Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Shadow Ghoul!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my Diabao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ambush attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A valiant effort, Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you can't use\Nthe same trick twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My ghoul, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it goes a piece of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid it is all\Nover for you, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Game has ended, and\Nyour dear bound is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's that I see\Ncreeping up behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my Shadow Ghoul\Ncan pass through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I must have forgotten to mention this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear bound has the\Nunique ability to inherit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the powers of every monster he\Ndefeats in battle. That cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you can say I'm not the only\None with a knack for stealing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Mona, why have you\Ncome to Mahad's Tablet Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but I had this really bad dream that Master\NMahad was in trouble and needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He was struggling, Pharaoh, and I could\Nswear that he was calling my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what else to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and I thought maybe if I came to his\Nsanctuary, I could help him or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I had the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mahad's illusion magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have called it into battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But it lives inside Mahad's soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If he loses it, then my master\Ncan't exist in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All good Shadow Kings\Nmust come to an end! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You out there, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, say it ain't so.\NWhat's the problem, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem? A\Nbad drawing of a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I marked that door so we'd know that we\Nalready went down this path Good idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,who knew you had it in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we ever get out of\Nhere, invest in an art class
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good one Who asked you, snotty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shoddy. All right, break it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, we have to find the right door,\Nand that's not helping. We'll never find
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that door not if we keep walking in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,circles he's got a point\Nface it we're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,be stuck in this place with that ghost\Nin a bathrobe for the rest of our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,oh way to keep a positive attitude for\Nyour information it's a Sacred cloak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bathrobe, cloak, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is we're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're making it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he found the right door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I get the feeling something's\Non the other side of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Faro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Okora!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we try the next door!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean besides the really bad sunburn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing, because I\Nwas about to fight fire with fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have now seen the Pharaoh's\Nenemy in his true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,His true enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my Dearbound has\Npicked up a few new tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you may as well bid your\Nillusion magician farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And once he's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be sealed in stone, and you'll\Nbe sealed in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't deny your destiny, Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me? Is it\Nnot obvious this sanctuary is home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.47,0:11:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to several traps so i used my magic\Nto conceal them and let you take
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,care of the rest you'll never contain\Nme really because by the looks
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,of you it appears that i already
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,have now to finish this it is over my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, Mahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear this place contains some traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but do you mind if I cut in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for your magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabau!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate him with\Nyour helical shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, I seem to have forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies beyond those hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Spellcaster's training grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Mahat have gone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He is battling Bakura, my pharaoh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, we must send word\Nto the others. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:14:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to deal with these\Nthugs. Mana, get down! Be-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,careful all right today\Nyou have met your match
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.03,0:14:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,looks to me like you could use some rest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you and i make\Na little deal it's simple
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,bring the millennium ring to\Nme and i I will spare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay and fight, and I'll see to it that\Nyour soul is removed from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Permanently!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad needs us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He cannot defeat Bakura alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.65,0:14:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall never give in to you. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, it must be difficult for\Nsomeone like you to understand loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have taken a vow to protect my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps in your eyes, but I know my\Npharaoh would do the same thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahat, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry about me. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my prince The future\Npharaoh need not do this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You were bit by a snake And\NI am getting the poison out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh It is now time I\Nshall finally repay my debt
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been separated from his item.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, you are treading\Ndown a dangerous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already destroyed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of cheap magician's\Ntrick are you playing on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It is no trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I used my remaining\Npower to merge together
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,with my illusion magician and defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabau, finish him off with\Nyour helical shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Mahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My master!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul is sealed in that stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Feel what? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The room just got cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.81,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My Pharaoh, I have made\Nthe ultimate sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I am able to become\Nyour eternal servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It just got warm in here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is because this labyrinth is\Na reflection of the Pharaoh's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature changes\Naccording to his emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, you must listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you do so carefully\Nenough, you will locate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole time we thought\Nwe had to knock on his door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But what we really need to do is\Nwait for the Pharaoh to knock for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You must listen with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet if we all concentrate at the\Nsame time, we'll be able to hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's stop yapping and start\Nlistening. Yeah, thanks guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,hands in we always have to do\Nthe hand thing joey why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you take your own advice and\Nconcentrate she's right close
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your eyes and listen the\Npharaoh cries out to you listen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like the pharaoh. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must be close. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
